help/trans A x y z (pair X1/1 X1/2) (pair X2/1 X2/2) (pair X3/1 X3/2) :- help/trans/1 A x y z X1/1 X2/1 X3/1 , help/trans/2 A x y z X1/2 X2/2 X3/2.

/* generated from trans3 : {A,w,x,y,z:tm A}ded (equal A w x)⟶ded (equal A x y)⟶ded (equal A y z)⟶ded (equal A w z) */

ded X4 (equal A w z) :- help/trans3 A w x y z X1 X2 X3 X4 , ded X1 (equal A w x) , ded X2 (equal A x y) , ded X3 (equal A y z).

